# Request — open a new recording episode, stamping provenance onto it.
# Replaces the bare std_srvs/Trigger so the caller records HOW the episode was
# produced. The recorder carries these onto add_episode(), which writes them as
# the per-episode `source`/`policy` fields in dataset_metadata.json.
string source    # "teleop" | "rollout" | "replay"; "" is treated as "teleop"
string policy    # checkpoint/version id of the model driving a rollout ("" if n/a)
---
# Response
bool success
string message
